><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ka ke ru na ra no ru ka so ru ka</span></p><p begin="00:09.672" end="00:12.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:09.672" end="00:11.296">まだまだだ</span> <span begin="00:11.296" end="00:11.830">Change</span> <span begin="00:11.830" end="00:12.011">the</span> <span begin="00:12.011" end="00:12.680">world</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这样根本不够</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da ma da da</span></p><p begin="00:12.390" end="00:15.698" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:12.390" end="00:12.520">It's</span> <span begin="00:12.520" end="00:12.720">time</span> <span begin="00:12.720" end="00:12.888">for</span> <span begin="00:12.888" end="00:13.246">the</span> <span begin="00:13.454" end="00:14.155">uprising,</span> <span begin="00:14.155" end="00:14.847">uprising,</span><span begin="00:14.847" end="00:15.225">(Get</span> <span begin="00:15.225" end="00:15.698">over)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是时候掀起一场革命了 起义吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">It's time for the uprising uprising</span></p><p begin="00:15.698" end="00:18.707" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:15.698" end="00:15.925">the</span> <span begin="00:16.244" end="00:16.874">uprising,</span> <span begin="00:16.978" end="00:17.660">uprising</span><span begin="00:17.660" end="00:17.860">(Get</span> <span begin="00:17.860" end="00:18.707">over)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">超越自我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">The uprising uprising</span></p><p begin="00:18.848" end="00:23.961" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:18.848" end="00:19.869">衝動で</span><span begin="00:19.869" end="00:22.139">刻めCoun</span><span begin="00:22.139" end="00:23.961">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">凭冲动将反击铭刻骨血</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u do u de ki za mu counter</span></p><p begin="00:25.951" end="00:33.033" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:25.951" end="00:26.695">Raise</span> <span begin="00:26.695" end="00:27.356">Hell!</span> <span begin="00:28.732" end="00:29.481">Raise</span> <span begin="00:29.481" end="00:30.204">Hell!</span> <span begin="00:31.564" end="00:32.281">Raise</span> <span begin="00:32.281" end="00:33.033">Hell!</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">大规模掀起革命</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">Raise hell</span></p><p begin="00:35.788" end="00:41.191" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:35.788" end="00:36.735">前だ</span><span begin="00:36.735" end="00:37.292">けを見</span><span begin="00:37.292" end="00:37.833">た</span> <span begin="00:38.108" end="00:38.977">奪い</span><span begin="00:38.977" end="00:39.978">尽くす</span><span begin="00:39.978" end="00:40.276">よう</span><span begin="00:40.276" end="00:41.191">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只需向前看 似要将一切掠夺殆尽</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma e da ke wo mi ta u ba i tsu ku su yo u ni</span></p><p begin="00:40.655" end="00:42.767" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:40.655" end="00:41.295">一生涯All</span> <span begin="00:41.295" end="00:41.644">bet</span> <span begin="00:41.644" end="00:42.767">最高級品悪童</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">赌上自己的一生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i 's sho u ga i all bet</span></p><p begin="00:42.767" end="00:45.231" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:42.767" end="00:43.644">異端児から</span><span begin="00:43.644" end="00:44.178">の</span><span begin="00:44.178" end="00:45.231">超問題児</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再到超级问题少年 抱歉我从来都不讨喜</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">cho u mo n da i ji ka wa i ge na i ko de I'm sorry</span></p><p begin="00:45.231" end="00:46.968" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:45.231" end="00:46.056">可愛げない子でI'm</span> <span be